<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student View | Electra</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/sidebar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/dashboard.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/electives.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/app-polish.css">
    <style>
      .student-view-content{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}.catalogue-intro{padding:30px 32px;border-radius:18px;background:#4A231A;color:#F8F3ED;margin-bottom:30px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px}.catalogue-intro .eyebrow{color:#E7B69D}.catalogue-intro h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);margin:8px 0 12px}.catalogue-intro p{color:#F0DDD1;max-width:650px;margin:0;line-height:1.75}.intro-mark{width:105px;height:105px;border:1px solid #BFA18B;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font:4.5rem Georgia,serif;color:#E7C5A7;flex-shrink:0}.catalogue-tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(190px,1fr);gap:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #EFE7DE;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:22px}.catalogue-tools label{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#4C4039;margin-bottom:8px}.catalogue-tools .form-control,.catalogue-tools .form-select{min-height:44px;border-color:#DCCBB9;border-radius:9px}.student-elective-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.student-elective-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #EFE7DE;border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:300px;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}.student-elective-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #432c2014}.student-elective-card-head{background:#F1E4D5;padding:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.student-elective-card-head .elective-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:#4A231A;color:#F8F3ED;font:1.1rem Georgia,serif}.student-elective-card-head .category-tag{font-size:.72rem;background:#fff;color:#4A231A;border-radius:30px;padding:6px 10px}.student-elective-card-body{padding:22px;display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column}.student-elective-card-body .elective-code{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#A46A50}.student-elective-card-body h3{font:400 1.45rem/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#2C2623;margin:8px 0 10px}.student-elective-card-body p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7;color:#776A61}.elective-card-meta{margin-top:auto;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #F0E7DE;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;color:#6D5E53;font-size:.85rem}.elective-card-meta strong{color:#42362F}.student-view-note{background:#F1E4D5;padding:15px 18px;border-radius:10px;color:#66564A;margin:22px 0;font-size:.88rem}.student-view-empty{display:none;text-align:center;background:#fff;border:1px dashed #DCCBB9;border-radius:14px;padding:45px 20px;color:#776A61}.student-view-empty.show{display:block}.student-view-bottom{margin-top:35px;padding:28px 30px;border-radius:16px;background:#EFE1D0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.student-view-bottom h2{font:400 1.7rem Georgia,serif;margin:5px 0}.student-view-bottom p{margin:0;color:#76675B}.student-view-bottom .btn{background:#4A231A;color:white;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 16px;white-space:nowrap}.student-view-bottom .btn:hover{background:#855E4E}@media(max-width:1000px){.student-elective-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:700px){.catalogue-intro{padding:25px;}.intro-mark{display:none}.catalogue-tools{grid-template-columns:1fr}.student-elective-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.student-view-bottom{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
    </style>
</head>
<body data-user-id="${sessionScope.userId}" data-role="${sessionScope.role}">
<div class="app-layout">
<jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/partials/sidebar.jsp">
    <jsp:param name="active" value="electives"/>
</jsp:include>
<main class="main-content"><header class="topbar"><div><div class="topbar-label">Academic Workspace</div><div class="topbar-title">Student View</div></div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="status-dot"></span><span class="academic-year">Academic Year 2026–27</span></div></header>
<section class="page-content student-view-content">
<section class="catalogue-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR ACADEMIC JOURNEY</span><h1>Explore what <em>moves you.</em></h1><p>Discover departmental electives, compare subject areas, and find options that align with your interests and future goals.</p></div><div class="intro-mark" aria-hidden="true">E</div></section>
<div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Elective Catalogue</h2><p>Browse the subjects available for this academic year.</p></div><span class="catalogue-count" id="electiveCount">0 electives</span></div>
<div class="catalogue-tools"><div><label for="searchInput">Search electives</label><input id="searchInput" type="search" class="form-control" placeholder="Search by name, code, or topic..."></div><div><label for="departmentFilter">Category</label><select id="departmentFilter" class="form-select"><option value="all">All categories</option><option value="Professional Elective">Professional Elective</option><option value="Departmental">Departmental</option><option value="Open Elective">Open Elective</option><option value="AI & Data">AI &amp; Data</option><option value="Software">Software</option><option value="Networks">Networks</option><option value="Security">Security</option></select></div></div>
<div class="student-view-note"><strong>Note:</strong> Elective information shown here is based on the catalogue available in this browser. Check with your department for official eligibility and seat confirmation.</div>
<div id="electiveGrid" class="student-elective-grid" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="emptyState" class="student-view-empty"><h3>No electives found</h3><p>Try another keyword or select a different category.</p><button id="clearFilters" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Clear filters</button></div>
<section class="student-view-bottom"><div><span class="eyebrow">READY TO DECIDE?</span><h2>Your next step starts with a choice.</h2><p>Once you have explored the catalogue, arrange your preferences in order.</p></div><a href="preferences.jsp" class="btn">Rank My Preferences <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
<footer class="page-footer"><span>Electra</span> · Departmental Elective Allocation System <span class="footer-year">2026–27</span></footer>
</section></main></div>
<script src="assets/js/electives.js"></script>
</body></html>